e5f7ce6d25ff19facaee41a558c5c59.avif?t=1772965959\" width=620 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MegaQuest"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/db376fe30a55b8f76480479a3d404acc0574f1df/header.jpg?t=1772965959","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093910/1708064800/d9e79e89c0a6c9da8b476b8df93603cb9dca0fff/1767076433/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767078983","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093910/1708064800/d9e79e89c0a6c9da8b476b8df93603cb9dca0fff/1767076433/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767078983","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093910/1708064800/d9e79e89c0a6c9da8b476b8df93603cb9dca0fff/1767076433/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767078983","id":257256926,"name":"Trailer -- Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257256926/a38a252783f6dab19f151b27f590d9e5250254f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767078983"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093910/1578724566/e2da8323ec7219fd043dde57d2c4b54db69a870a/1763919383/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763921482","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093910/1578724566/e2da8323ec7219fd043dde57d2c4b54db69a870a/1763919383/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763921482","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093910/1578724566/e2da8323ec7219fd043dde57d2c4b54db69a870a/1763919383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763921482","id":257236644,"name":"Temple of the Lizard Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257236644/ce94e7b78dbb0ff4a43400ebaa1888c61b66f0b4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763921482"}],"name":"Dokkalfar: The Ballads of Vivi the Dark Elf","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Steam Deck Compatible</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["MegaQuest"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cI've played quite a few different Metroidvanias over the past few years, and even so, I think the game seemed quite original due to its combination of elements.\u201d<br />\r\nPlaytester, 31, Spain<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cThis is not usually the type of game I go out of my way to play when in my free time. Not saying I don't ever, it's just not typically a go to for me. However, I enjoy being Vivi so much and the story felt like it has great potential that I really want to actually get the game when it comes out. The story was done well enough to make the challenge of the game worth it to me.\u201d<br />\r\nPlaytester, 29, USA<br />\r\n","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/78d3ed7c984e3315173c7cd9e9336566597ae372/ss_78d3ed7c984e3315173c7cd9e9336566597ae372.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772965959","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/78d3ed7c984e3315173c7cd9e9336566597ae372/ss_78d3ed7c984e3315173c7cd9e9336566597ae372.600x338.jpg?t=1772965959"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/4b6b6dbc4095e9a71fd352198df4c4e8e1b86015/ss_4b6b6dbc4095e9a71fd352198df4c4e8e1b86015.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772965959","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/4b6b6dbc4095e9a71fd352198df4c4e8e1b86015/ss_4b6b6dbc4095e9a71fd352198df4c4e8e1b86015.600x338.jpg?t=1772965959"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/632cfcd65accf264ff199dd36b9fa888a28dfef7/ss_632cfcd65accf264ff199dd36b9fa888a28dfef7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772965959","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/632cfcd65accf264ff199dd36b9fa888a28dfef7/ss_632cfcd65accf264ff199dd36b9fa888a28dfef7.600x338.jpg?t=1772965959"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/41e3ce619a3a5e8e6ac11bc99313e3b7ea7d8b7a/ss_41e3ce619a3a5e8e6ac11bc99313e3b7ea7d8b7a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772965959","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/41e3ce619a3a5e8e6ac11bc99313e3b7ea7d8b7a/ss_41e3ce619a3a5e8e6ac11bc99313e3b7ea7d8b7a.600x338.jpg?t=1772965959"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/88d307bb9260f93a2c8c0dc603ed8b1549b54fb1/ss_88d307bb9260f93a2c8c0dc603ed8b1549b54fb1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772965959","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste